#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:199
#: e5145bc9517e4b4b814d9d38b942bc56
msgid ""
"Poses are `geometry_msgs/Pose` (no `header`), in the robot world frame "
"(`x` forward, `y` left, `z` up). WebXR publishes on a fixed 30 Hz timer. "
"XRoboToolkit publishes when the VR `timeStampNs` changes: about 90 Hz "
"with the default Pico App, and about 400 Hz with the enterprise send rate"
" over USB."
msgstr "位姿是 `geometry_msgs/Pose`（没有 `header`），在机器人世界系（`x` 向前、`y` 向左、`z` 向上）。WebXR 用固定 30 Hz 定时器发布。XRoboToolkit 在 VR `timeStampNs` 变化时发布：默认 Pico App 大约 90 Hz，企业发送速率走 USB 时大约 400 Hz。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:201
#: 224e9032661e4ea88841ddb563ac9c05
msgid ""
"Pull depth stays on `/teleop/trigger_values` every frame. The press edge "
"is a separate code on `/teleop/controller_state` (`9` left, `10` right)."
msgstr "行程深度每帧都在 `/teleop/trigger_values`。按下边沿是 `/teleop/controller_state` 上的另一个码（左 `9`，右 `10`）。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:203
#: bc8bc24f4d0c44fc8ea138acf7f04d20
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`VRInputHandler` in `arms_target_manager` subscribes to the pose topics, "
"`/teleop/controller_state`, `/teleop/thumbstick_axes`, and "
"`/teleop/trigger_values`. In UPDATE it drives arm targets from the "
"controller poses. Grippers that are in percent mode follow "
"`trigger_values`. The latched mode is `teleop/mode_state` "
"(`TeleopModeState`). Headset button behavior: {ref}`VR Teleoperation "
"<controller-buttons>`. How to read the latch: {ref}`teleop-mode-status`."
msgstr "`arms_target_manager` 里的 `VRInputHandler` 订阅位姿话题、`/teleop/controller_state`、`/teleop/thumbstick_axes` 和 `/teleop/trigger_values`。UPDATE 时它用手柄位姿驱动手臂目标。百分比模式的夹爪跟随 `trigger_values`。锁存模式是 `teleop/mode_state`（`TeleopModeState`）。头显按键：{ref}`VR 遥操作 <controller-buttons>`。怎么读锁存：{ref}`teleop-mode-status`。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:205
#: 1d2277cd33c24afaa85c2a4a4a9b6233
msgid ""
"The names above are the root topics in the protocol (`/teleop/...`). "
"`teleop/mode_state` is relative to the robot namespace; the VR how-to "
"shows the latch fields."
msgstr "上面这些名字是协议里的根话题（`/teleop/...`）。`teleop/mode_state` 相对机器人命名空间；锁存字段见 VR 遥操作页。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:207
#: b9577247e0644b61a6548b1cb6eb5455
msgid ""
"Optical wrist presets also publish `/teleop/optical_r0_caps`, "
"`/teleop/optical_r0_request`, `/teleop/optical_r0_ready`, and "
"`/teleop/mirror_mode`. The handshake is in the same protocol."
msgstr "光学腕预设还会发布 `/teleop/optical_r0_caps`、`/teleop/optical_r0_request`、`/teleop/optical_r0_ready` 和 `/teleop/mirror_mode`。握手过程在同一份协议里。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:209
#: e088ab71ed234b68a1b3e64cccad10dc
msgid "Topic vs Action vs Service"
msgstr "话题 vs Action vs Service"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:211
#: 177a301f0eca418db10ffcd8d4099f3d
msgid ""
"Same motion can exist as a **topic** (fire-and-forget), an **action** "
"(goal, progress feedback, result), and sometimes a **service** (one-shot "
"RPC). Definitions: [`arms_ros2_control_msgs` README](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/README.md)."
" Which names a controller actually advertises is on that controller; the "
"tables below list the types in that README."
msgstr ""
"同一运动可以是**话题**（发出即走）、**Action**（目标、进度反馈、结果），有时还有**服务**（一次请求/响应）。定义见 "
"[`arms_ros2_control_msgs` README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/README.md)。控制器实际"
" advertise 哪些名字以该控制器为准；下表列出该 README 中的类型。"

