#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:222
#: 8c91cc2a07b640afae0fad5d27e1af6b
msgid "Switch whole-body modes (`/mode_command`)"
msgstr "切换全身模式（`/mode_command`）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:224
#: dbba3931ed5e498086413b1d28103feb
msgid ""
"`/mode_command` is **`std_msgs/String`** on the **全身 / WBC** stack. It is"
" not `/fsm_command`, and it is not a write path for "
"`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state`. That topic is feedback only. Same "
"availability as the body/head Cartesian topics above: 分体 and default mock"
" demos do not start this path."
msgstr ""
"`/mode_command` 是全身 / WBC 栈上的 **`std_msgs/String`**。它不是 "
"`/fsm_command`，也不能用来向 `/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state` "
"写入；那个话题只是反馈。可用性与上文的身体/头部笛卡尔话题相同：分体和默认的 mock 演示不会启动这条路径。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:226
#: 24b28cda0c7241f180f3b64ef7356f34
msgid ""
"The usual sequence is: confirm that `ocs2_wbc_controller` is running, "
"switch the FSM to **OCS2** if it is not already there, publish the mode "
"string, then confirm the matching field on "
"`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state`. You can also publish the mode while"
" still in **HOLD** or **MOVEJ** and then enter OCS2; entering OCS2 keeps "
"the mode you already set. Leaving OCS2, or activating the controller, "
"restores the default mode."
msgstr ""
"通常做法是：先确认 `ocs2_wbc_controller` 已在运行，若 FSM 还不是 **OCS2** "
"就先切过去，再发布模式字符串，然后在 `/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state` 上确认对应字段。也可以在仍处于 "
"**HOLD** 或 **MOVEJ** 时先发布模式，再进入 OCS2；进入 OCS2 会保留你已经设好的模式。离开 "
"OCS2，或激活控制器时，会恢复默认模式。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:228
#: 01b37e6cd5e74e78b873493d3e566cde
msgid "First check whether the robot supports the mode you want:"
msgstr "先确认机器人是否支持你要的模式："

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:230
#: e3029126427642aab95aabef9969fea9
msgid "ros2 topic echo /ocs2_wbc_controller/wbc_capabilities\n"
msgstr "ros2 topic echo /ocs2_wbc_controller/wbc_capabilities\n"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:234
#: 22455bdd1768461d8ad989b47c6b613d
msgid ""
"If the relevant `WbcCapability` bit is `false`, the controller will not "
"apply that command. These bits come from the robot's OCS2 task `.info` "
"file, for example `headMidpointGaze`, `headTrackingEE`, `headCoupling`, "
"and `homeJointReference`. If the controller runs in a namespace, use its "
"actual topic names."
msgstr ""
"如果对应的 `WbcCapability` 位是 `false`，控制器不会应用这条命令。这些能力位来自机器人的 OCS2 任务 `.info` "
"文件，例如 `headMidpointGaze`、`headTrackingEE`、`headCoupling` 和 "
"`homeJointReference`。控制器带命名空间时，请使用实际的话题名。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:236
#: 64f11cb674764accad5b6bd8cf5b1a4f
msgid ""
"For a controller that is already running, enter OCS2 if needed, then "
"request the mode and inspect the feedback:"
msgstr "控制器已运行时，如有需要先进入 OCS2，再请求模式并查看反馈："

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:238
#: b63f36e6a12c4c5fa4f8de8016a7aacd
msgid ""
"ros2 topic pub --once /fsm_command std_msgs/msg/Int32 \"data: 3\"\n"
"ros2 topic pub --once /mode_command std_msgs/msg/String \"data: "
"'BODY_TRACKING'\"\n"
"ros2 topic echo /ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state\n"
msgstr ""
"ros2 topic pub --once /fsm_command std_msgs/msg/Int32 \"data: 3\"\n"
"ros2 topic pub --once /mode_command std_msgs/msg/String \"data: "
"'BODY_TRACKING'\"\n"
"ros2 topic echo /ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state\n"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:244
#: 98d1fcef30a141ebb54fa493cfe7ab91
msgid ""
"Replace the string with any command in the tables below. In Python, call "
"`send_mode_command(...)`, then `wait_until_mode_commands_applied(...)`. "
"If you send several modes, publish them all first, then wait once on the "
"combined list; do not wait after every command. The RViz OCS2 panel "
"publishes the same strings when the corresponding capability is enabled."
msgstr ""
"把字符串换成下表中的任意命令。在 Python 中，先调用 `send_mode_command(...)`，再调用 "
"`wait_until_mode_commands_applied(...)`。如果要发多条模式，先全部发布，再对合并后的列表等待一次，不要每条都等。能力开启时，RViz"
" 的 OCS2 面板也会发布相同的字符串。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:246
#: 8706c28e342546ee94199f59733b0f6a
msgid ""
"interface.send_fsm_command(3)  # OCS2\n"
"interface.send_mode_command(\"BODY_TRACKING\")\n"
"interface.send_mode_command(\"BASE_LOCK\")\n"
"ok = interface.wait_until_mode_commands_applied(\n"
"    [\"BODY_TRACKING\", \"BASE_LOCK\"],\n"
"    timeout=5.0,\n"
")\n"
msgstr ""
"interface.send_fsm_command(3)  # OCS2\n"
"interface.send_mode_command(\"BODY_TRACKING\")\n"
"interface.send_mode_command(\"BASE_LOCK\")\n"
"ok = interface.wait_until_mode_commands_applied(\n"
"    [\"BODY_TRACKING\", \"BASE_LOCK\"],\n"
"    timeout=5.0,\n"
")\n"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:256
#: 995811c317254ae3ae605fbc2956d857
msgid ""
"When the command is accepted, the matching `current_state` field changes."
" That reports a selected mode or an active task, not that a pose has "
"already been reached. A worked sequence is in the [mode-command check "
"example](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/examples/test/01_mode_and_fsm/check_mode_commands.py)."
" The current Python mapping is `MODE_COMMAND_TO_WBC_EXPECT` in the "
"[interface source](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/ros2_robot_interface/ros_interface.py)."
msgstr ""
"命令被接受后，对应的 `current_state` "
"字段会改变。这表示已选中某个模式，或某项任务已激活，不表示位姿已经到达。完整示例见[模式命令检查脚本](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/examples/test/01_mode_and_fsm/check_mode_commands.py)。当前"
" Python 映射为[接口源码](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/ros2_robot_interface/ros_interface.py)中的"
" `MODE_COMMAND_TO_WBC_EXPECT`。"

