#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:275
#: cd7bc374253f4dcf88b87622c02cfc21
msgid "Head"
msgstr "头部"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:277
#: 5d7527489a7c4d37b7aa9d8106a1a0cf
msgid ""
"Head modes are mutually exclusive, and they are independent of the body "
"mode. `head_midpoint_gaze_active` is not a separate command; it becomes "
"`true` only after `HEAD_GAZE` is active. Send `HEAD_DISABLE` to stop "
"gaze."
msgstr ""
"头部模式彼此互斥，并且独立于身体模式。`head_midpoint_gaze_active` 不是一条单独的命令；它只在 `HEAD_GAZE` "
"生效后才会变成 `true`。发送 `HEAD_DISABLE` 可停止注视。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 0d5b15b8781146e3a80e5be11cd83816
msgid "`HEAD_DISABLE`"
msgstr "`HEAD_DISABLE`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 1ccd319c8063419c93ed932ad5396bee
msgid ""
"`head_state` = `0` (`HEAD_DISABLED`); `head_midpoint_gaze_active` is "
"`false`"
msgstr "`head_state` = `0`（`HEAD_DISABLED`），`head_midpoint_gaze_active` 为 `false`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 90af929364b3405880669e388d43e2df
msgid "`HEAD_TRACKING`"
msgstr "`HEAD_TRACKING`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: e6c572822c7e43338a1a421e172f9feb
msgid "`head_state` = `1` (`HEAD_TRACKING`)"
msgstr "`head_state` = `1` (`HEAD_TRACKING`)"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: d252f25be41944589832e81fba25b2ef
msgid ""
"`head_tracking_ee_enabled`, from the `headTrackingEE` section. After this"
" mode is on, publish a target on `/head_target` or "
"`/head_target/stamped`; otherwise the head will not move."
msgstr ""
"`head_tracking_ee_enabled`，来自 `headTrackingEE` 段。进入该模式后，还需要向 "
"`/head_target` 或 `/head_target/stamped` 发布目标，否则头部不会运动。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 9812d68cd25e4191821f871a30e50728
msgid "`HEAD_GAZE`"
msgstr "`HEAD_GAZE`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 50f05a8343424561a3ac609ca70510c3
msgid "`head_state` = `2` (`HEAD_GAZE`) and `head_midpoint_gaze_active` = `true`"
msgstr "`head_state` = `2`（`HEAD_GAZE`），且 `head_midpoint_gaze_active` = `true`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 99d8cb3e99db4f1fb286219956abb8e9
msgid ""
"`head_midpoint_gaze_enabled`, from the top-level `headMidpointGaze` "
"section (`activate`, `cameraFrame`, and the camera parameters). This "
"reports an active task, not that the head is already aligned or that the "
"target is reachable."
msgstr ""
"`head_midpoint_gaze_enabled`，来自顶层 `headMidpointGaze` "
"段（`activate`、`cameraFrame` 以及相机参数）。这表示任务已激活，不表示头部已经对准，也不表示目标可达。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 748d250e55904af9af255eefef8f97a1
msgid "`HEAD_FORWARD`"
msgstr "`HEAD_FORWARD`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 3e4f91df10544c5d96328b570683e702
msgid "`head_state` = `3` (`HEAD_FORWARD`)"
msgstr "`head_state` = `3` (`HEAD_FORWARD`)"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: f90e1cd3d7bd418d9f940afd5b0362d1
msgid ""
"`has_head_coupling`, from the `headCoupling` section. In this mode, "
"`body_state` still reports the body mode you selected, but the former "
"lock-head constraints temporarily override it. Leaving `HEAD_FORWARD` "
"restores that body selection."
msgstr ""
"`has_head_coupling`，来自 `headCoupling` 段。在此模式下，`body_state` "
"仍回报你选择的身体模式，但会暂时被原来的锁头约束覆盖。退出 `HEAD_FORWARD` 后，该身体选择会恢复。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:286
#: 9cf149d756f34d4a902c3580901c4f8b
msgid "Arms"
msgstr "手臂"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:288
#: 10240f3c75904c56ae24a9eb6e99c711
msgid ""
"Switch a single arm only while the arms are independent. If they are "
"already coupled, `LEFT_ARM_*` and `RIGHT_ARM_*` are ignored. "
"`ARMS_COUPLED` is accepted only when both arms are enabled."
msgstr ""
"只有在双臂独立时才能切换单臂使能。如果已经耦合，`LEFT_ARM_*` 和 `RIGHT_ARM_*` 会被忽略。只有左右臂都已启用时，才会接受"
" `ARMS_COUPLED`。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 21a21f539178471f98092f1be8cfb600
msgid "`ARMS_INDEPENDENT`"
msgstr "`ARMS_INDEPENDENT`"

