#: c7abddf711d64865bf2831eb6612d5d4
msgid "`right_arm_state` = `1` (`ARM_ENABLED`) or `0` (`ARM_DISABLED`)"
msgstr "`right_arm_state` = `1` (`ARM_ENABLED`) or `0` (`ARM_DISABLED`)"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:297
#: d6f58179d6f046c8947325537faeb078
msgid "HOME joint reference"
msgstr "HOME 关节参考"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: fbe3181f34e9400ebcc42bb72e7b90bc
msgid "`HOME_JOINT_ON`"
msgstr "`HOME_JOINT_ON`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 241b05e252354d5fa20f01aa910f2c79
msgid "`home_joint_reference_enabled` = `true`"
msgstr "`home_joint_reference_enabled` = `true`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 852b83f195404b8d9e9b1860939d2937
msgid "`HOME_JOINT_OFF`"
msgstr "`HOME_JOINT_OFF`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: c73ebe84400b42ebb94cba90d2183820
msgid "`home_joint_reference_enabled` = `false`"
msgstr "`home_joint_reference_enabled` = `false`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:304
#: f2581e127c0049fcac2378befc7eb26c
msgid ""
"`HOME_JOINT_ON` and `HOME_JOINT_OFF` turn the HOME joint-reference "
"constraint on or off. This is a constraint switch, not a report that the "
"FSM is in HOME. Confirm it on `home_joint_reference_enabled`. The "
"constraint can be applied while the FSM is in HOLD, MOVEJ, or OCS2, but "
"the usual sequence is still to enter OCS2 first."
msgstr ""
"`HOME_JOINT_ON` 和 `HOME_JOINT_OFF` 用于打开或关闭 HOME 关节参考约束。这是约束开关，并不表示 FSM 处于"
" HOME。请在 `home_joint_reference_enabled` 上确认。该约束可以在 FSM 处于 HOLD、MOVEJ 或 "
"OCS2 时应用，但通常仍建议先进入 OCS2。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:306
#: 504ea3e0132d47ac8601c5966a825f67
msgid ""
"The capability bit is `has_home_joint_reference`, from the "
"`homeJointReference` section. If that bit is `false`, the controller "
"ignores the command. If `HOME_JOINT_ON` is rejected, for example because "
"the current home reference is outside the URDF joint limits, "
"`home_joint_reference_enabled` stays `false`."
msgstr ""
"对应的能力位是 `has_home_joint_reference`，来自 `homeJointReference` 段。如果该位为 "
"`false`，控制器会忽略这条命令。如果 `HOME_JOINT_ON` 被拒绝，例如当前 HOME 参考超出了 URDF "
"关节限位，`home_joint_reference_enabled` 会保持为 `false`。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:308
#: 2a7653345b164d40b3ab5e92b6b73b27
msgid ""
"The controller also accepts body presets of the form `PRESET:HM_*`. Those"
" change the body, arms, and base together and leave the current head mode"
" unchanged. Confirm the result on `current_state`; the Python mapping "
"does not list these preset names."
msgstr ""
"控制器也接受形如 `PRESET:HM_*` 的身体预设。它们会同时改变身体、双臂和底盘，并保留当前的头部模式。请在 "
"`current_state` 上确认结果；Python 映射里没有列出这些预设名。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:311
#: 2acbfdbab6754e04bd2d597b95b27793
msgid "Read the current WBC modes (`current_state`)"
msgstr "查看当前全身控制模式（`current_state`）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:313
#: ed915f5a93804de981b66b5b820b21a0
msgid ""
"Subscribe to `/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state` to see the modes "
"reported by the whole-body controller. The message type is "
"`arms_ros2_control_msgs/msg/WbcCurrentState`. These fields describe WBC "
"modes and constraints, not joint positions or motion completion. They are"
" separate from the FSM state on `/fsm_state`."
msgstr ""
"订阅 `/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state` 可以查看全身控制器反馈的模式，消息类型是 "
"`arms_ros2_control_msgs/msg/WbcCurrentState`。这些字段表示 WBC "
"的模式和约束，不表示关节位置或运动是否完成，也不是 `/fsm_state` 中的控制器状态。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:315
#: 3845cdd458004445af9f10444d442b61
msgid ""
"With the whole-body controller running and its workspace sourced, inspect"
" the feedback and the installed message definition:"
msgstr "启动全身控制器并 source 对应工作空间后，可以查看状态反馈和本机安装的消息定义："

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:317
#: 98dfbe414c37471386df9f3fbbd2878b
msgid ""
"ros2 topic echo /ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state\n"
"ros2 interface show arms_ros2_control_msgs/msg/WbcCurrentState\n"
msgstr ""
"ros2 topic echo /ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state\n"
"ros2 interface show arms_ros2_control_msgs/msg/WbcCurrentState\n"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:322
#: 6cb4814ef9124725a3f87a1094a241d4
msgid ""
"If the controller runs in a namespace, use its actual topic name. The "
"fields below follow the current [message definition](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/msg/WbcCurrentState.msg)"
" and [message package README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/README.md)."
msgstr ""
"控制器带命名空间时，请使用实际的话题名。下面的字段以当前[消息定义](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/msg/WbcCurrentState.msg)和[消息包"
" README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/README.md)"
" 为依据。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: b21b87353d4142e9a5d826d9120ceb64
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 9373378802b94408bf55aa7206517920
msgid "Values and meaning"
msgstr "取值与含义"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: dea95c0905b94684845802e4a129bacc
msgid "`base_state`"
msgstr "`base_state`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 691fed17fdcd44a88e15d6b4f4eff3e0 7e4a97a2e2604b818b72a8bdd728fdcb
#: 93f5c32d3df4425993f6221a7e6f1c79 a22ac2f828ce4ba0a4f2068ef8fe24c9
#: e90cac28d75f4894a33e113a5a3a3d61 fd4799403237470c8049c5fb943b9b47
msgid "`uint8`"
msgstr "`uint8`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: eedd9807eaaa4421b534e341a71dbff2
msgid "Base mode: `0` = `BASE_LOCKED` (locked); `1` = `BASE_UNLOCKED` (unlocked)."
msgstr "底盘模式：`0` 为 `BASE_LOCKED`（锁定），`1` 为 `BASE_UNLOCKED`（解锁）。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 7bb25461304941a89922d5165cd049fa
#, #
msgid "`body_state`"
msgstr "`body_state`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 8431e2bbf4c54f58a67233e213b0a8ac
msgid ""
"Selected body mode: `0` = `BODY_FREE` (free); `1` = `BODY_VERTICAL` "
"(vertical); `2` = `BODY_TRACKING` (tracking); `3` = `BODY_LOCKED` "
"(locked); `5` = `BODY_CUSTOM_LOCKED` (custom joint lock). The former "
"lock-head value `4` is no longer published."
msgstr ""
"选择的身体模式：`0` 为 `BODY_FREE`（自由），`1` 为 `BODY_VERTICAL`（竖直），`2` 为 "
"`BODY_TRACKING`（跟随），`3` 为 `BODY_LOCKED`（锁定），`5` 为 "
"`BODY_CUSTOM_LOCKED`（自定义关节锁定）。旧的锁头值 `4` 已不再发布。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: fba11621b1c34d3189f802a8332766b7
#, #
msgid "`bimanual_state`"
msgstr "`bimanual_state`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: b399446a1d6141ce806e82417a7dde36
msgid ""
"Arm coordination: `0` = `BIMANUAL_INDEPENDENT` (independent); `1` = "
"`BIMANUAL_COUPLED` (coupled)."
msgstr "双臂协同模式：`0` 为 `BIMANUAL_INDEPENDENT`（独立），`1` 为 `BIMANUAL_COUPLED`（耦合）。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 28f7c35a535349c9bfcc42c84d12d677
msgid "`left_arm_state`"
msgstr "`left_arm_state`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: de803de00a984c8284f2b3297a288ddb
msgid ""
"Left arm in WBC: `0` = `ARM_DISABLED` (disabled); `1` = `ARM_ENABLED` "
"(enabled)."
msgstr "WBC 中的左臂状态：`0` 为 `ARM_DISABLED`（禁用），`1` 为 `ARM_ENABLED`（启用）。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 54206a284eb043c988af5084c7784d4c
msgid "`right_arm_state`"
msgstr "`right_arm_state`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: f9a3ba3465ef4c98ad9557861b1e3bff
msgid ""
"Right arm in WBC: `0` = `ARM_DISABLED` (disabled); `1` = `ARM_ENABLED` "
"(enabled)."
msgstr "WBC 中的右臂状态：`0` 为 `ARM_DISABLED`（禁用），`1` 为 `ARM_ENABLED`（启用）。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 25a91b0f804e4055b346368e151cfb97
msgid "`home_joint_reference_enabled`"
msgstr "`home_joint_reference_enabled`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 1a2c9c23ef6f449bafd68ef6d5f4f591 519093a45a334943b282953121cdcb75
msgid "`bool`"
msgstr "`bool`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 089ceea6f5c54bc7a2d90384041b2a35
msgid ""
"Whether the HOME joint-reference constraint is on: `true` = on; `false` ="
" off. This is a constraint switch, not a report that the FSM is in HOME."
msgstr "HOME 关节参考约束是否打开：`true` 为打开，`false` 为关闭。这是约束开关，不表示 FSM 处于 HOME 状态。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: d15781d004354eae8a15869ed607eeb7
#, #
msgid "`head_state`"
msgstr "`head_state`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: cabfbefac3c94edcb31851d77b28b159
msgid ""
"Head mode: `0` = `HEAD_DISABLED` (disabled); `1` = `HEAD_TRACKING` (6D "
"pose tracking); `2` = `HEAD_GAZE` (gaze at the midpoint between the two "
"end effectors); `3` = `HEAD_FORWARD` (the former lock-head head/waist "
"coupling and waist constraints)."
msgstr ""
"头部模式：`0` 为 `HEAD_DISABLED`（禁用），`1` 为 `HEAD_TRACKING`（六维位姿跟踪），`2` 为 "
"`HEAD_GAZE`（注视双手末端中点），`3` 为 `HEAD_FORWARD`（原锁头模式的头腰联动及腰部约束）。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 68ba57b5c74a4e50a99e5daf949b7eaf
msgid "`head_midpoint_gaze_active`"
msgstr "`head_midpoint_gaze_active`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:178
#: 3fc6481742464a3e8e2fc5cd31494ce2
msgid ""
"Whether midpoint gaze is active. It is `true` only while `HEAD_GAZE` is "
"active, independently of the selected body mode. It does not guarantee "
"that the head is aligned with the target or that the target is reachable."
msgstr ""
"双手末端中点注视任务是否激活。只有 `HEAD_GAZE` 生效时才为 "
"`true`，与选择的身体模式无关。它不保证头部已经对准目标，也不保证目标可达。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:335
#: 7989eabebdd54831a145923f27e3d120
msgid "Interpret the feedback"
msgstr "怎样判断状态"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:337
#: 929dc9d7528c4415961f60eb9142a380
msgid ""
"In `HEAD_FORWARD`, `body_state` still reports the body mode you selected,"
" but the former lock-head constraints temporarily override it. Leaving "
"`HEAD_FORWARD` restores that body selection. Read `head_state` together "
"with `body_state` rather than treating the body field alone as the active"
" constraint set."
msgstr ""
"处于 `HEAD_FORWARD` 时，`body_state` 仍反馈之前选择的身体模式，但实际约束暂时由原锁头约束覆盖；退出 "
"`HEAD_FORWARD` 后恢复该身体选择。因此，判断当前约束时要同时看 `head_state` 和 "
"`body_state`，不能只看身体字段。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:339
#: 1e72ea051f0d45ba92c2c92a62ab45a6
msgid ""
"Capabilities and active states answer different questions. "
"`WbcCapability.head_midpoint_gaze_enabled` tells you whether midpoint "
"gaze is configured; `WbcCurrentState.head_midpoint_gaze_active` tells you"
" whether the task is active now. Likewise, "
"`WbcCapability.has_home_joint_reference` indicates support for the HOME "
"joint-reference constraint, while `home_joint_reference_enabled` reports "
"its current switch state."
msgstr ""
"能力和当前状态回答的是不同问题。`WbcCapability.head_midpoint_gaze_enabled` "
"表示是否配置了中点注视能力，`WbcCurrentState.head_midpoint_gaze_active` "
"表示此刻是否激活了该任务。同样，`WbcCapability.has_home_joint_reference` 表示是否支持 HOME "
"关节参考约束，`home_joint_reference_enabled` 则表示当前是否打开。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:341
#: 07f430ccba0d42379cd3e734c0d04517
msgid ""
"After a mode request, check the corresponding feedback field instead of "
"assuming that publishing a command means it was applied. For example, "
"`base_state: 0` reports a locked base, and `head_state: 2` with "
"`head_midpoint_gaze_active: true` reports an active midpoint-gaze task, "
"not that the head is already aligned."
msgstr ""
"发送模式请求后，要检查对应的反馈字段，不要把“命令已发出”当作“模式已生效”。例如，`base_state: 0` "
"表示底盘处于锁定模式；`head_state: 2` 且 `head_midpoint_gaze_active: true` "
"表示中点注视任务已激活，而不是头部已经对准。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:343
#: 98b38f434e4e42afa3e9647d345f9a5d
msgid ""
"If the installed definition differs from this table, check the message "
"package version. After a message upgrade, rebuild the dependent source "
"packages as needed and source the updated workspace before restarting "
"publishers and subscribers with matching interfaces."
msgstr ""
"如果本机消息定义与表格不同，请先核对消息包版本。升级消息定义后，按需重新构建依赖它的源码包，source "
"更新后的工作空间，再重新启动发布端和订阅端，让两端使用一致的接口。"

