"`execute_waist_lifting_pose_relative_action`。它们会阻塞直到有结果或超时。对应话题（`*/stamped`、`target_joint_trajectory`、`waist_lifting_pose_*`）**没有**结果。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:358
#: abecfc49c59e4bf4a03e7eedba7ffcf9
