#~ msgid "Switch on midpoint gaze (`HEAD_GAZE`)"
#~ msgstr "打开中点注视（`HEAD_GAZE`）"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Do not publish to "
#~ "`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state`. That topic is"
#~ " feedback. `head_state: 2` means "
#~ "`HEAD_GAZE`, and `head_midpoint_gaze_active` becomes"
#~ " `true` only after that mode is "
#~ "active. It is not a separate "
#~ "command."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "不要向 `/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state` "
#~ "发布。这个话题是状态反馈。`head_state: 2` 表示 "
#~ "`HEAD_GAZE`，`head_midpoint_gaze_active` 只在该模式生效后才会变成 "
#~ "`true`，它不是一条单独的命令。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "First confirm that midpoint gaze is "
#~ "configured: `WbcCapability.head_midpoint_gaze_enabled` "
#~ "should be `true`. This capability comes"
#~ " from the robot's OCS2 task `.info`"
#~ " file, in the top-level "
#~ "`headMidpointGaze` section (`activate`, "
#~ "`cameraFrame`, and the camera parameters). "
#~ "If the bit is false, the "
#~ "controller will not apply `HEAD_GAZE`. "
#~ "The FSM is usually already **OCS2**; "
#~ "otherwise the controller may ignore the"
#~ " mode command."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "先确认已经配置了中点注视：`WbcCapability.head_midpoint_gaze_enabled` 应为 "
#~ "`true`。该能力来自机器人 OCS2 任务 `.info` 文件中的顶层 "
#~ "`headMidpointGaze` 段（`activate`、`cameraFrame` "
#~ "以及相机参数）。如果该位为假，控制器不会应用 `HEAD_GAZE`。FSM 通常需要已经处于 "
#~ "**OCS2**，否则控制器可能忽略这条模式命令。"

#~ msgid "Then request the mode on `/mode_command`:"
#~ msgstr "然后向 `/mode_command` 请求该模式："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "ros2 topic pub --once /mode_command "
#~ "std_msgs/msg/String \"data: 'HEAD_GAZE'\"\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "ros2 topic pub --once /mode_command "
#~ "std_msgs/msg/String \"data: 'HEAD_GAZE'\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Or in Python, call "
#~ "`send_mode_command(\"HEAD_GAZE\")`, then "
#~ "`wait_until_mode_commands_applied([\"HEAD_GAZE\"])`. If "
#~ "the controller runs in a namespace, "
#~ "use its actual topic name. The "
#~ "RViz OCS2 panel also offers 注视 "
#~ "(Gaze) when this capability is enabled."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "在 Python 中，先调用 "
#~ "`send_mode_command(\"HEAD_GAZE\")`，再调用 "
#~ "`wait_until_mode_commands_applied([\"HEAD_GAZE\"])`。控制器带命名空间时，请使用实际的话题名。能力开启时，RViz"
#~ " 的 OCS2 面板里也有「注视」。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "When the command is accepted, "
#~ "`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state` should report "
#~ "`head_state: 2` (`HEAD_GAZE`) and "
#~ "`head_midpoint_gaze_active: true`. That reports "
#~ "an active task, not that the head"
#~ " is already aligned or that the "
#~ "target is reachable. Send `HEAD_DISABLE` "
#~ "to stop gaze. A worked sequence is"
#~ " in the [mode-command check "
#~ "example](https://github.com/fiveages-"
#~ "sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/examples/test/01_mode_and_fsm/check_mode_commands.py)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "命令被接受后，`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state` 应回报 "
#~ "`head_state: 2`（`HEAD_GAZE`）且 `head_midpoint_gaze_active:"
#~ " true`。这表示任务已激活，不表示头部已经对准，也不表示目标可达。发送 `HEAD_DISABLE` "
#~ "可停止注视。完整示例见[模式命令检查脚本](https://github.com/fiveages-"
#~ "sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/examples/test/01_mode_and_fsm/check_mode_commands.py)。"

#~ msgid "Then request the mode:"
#~ msgstr "然后请求该模式："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "ros2 topic pub --once /mode_command "
#~ "std_msgs/msg/String \"data: 'BODY_TRACKING'\"\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "ros2 topic pub --once /mode_command "
#~ "std_msgs/msg/String \"data: 'BODY_TRACKING'\"\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "When the command is accepted, the "
#~ "matching `current_state` field changes. That"
